  contentsAnswer: Nonmetallic sample weights and foam. They are packed in a centered
    rigid block.
  weightAnswer: About twelve kilos total. Nothing lightweight.
  metalAnswer: No electronics or metal apparatus.
  packingAnswer: The single block is fixed exactly in the center, evenly padded left
    and right.
  responseAnswer: Nothing should move. The block cannot shift in its housing.
  authorReasoning: A quiet, braced Mimic has no signature sound or counter-motion.
    Stable left-heavy center of mass around -4.2 cm contradicts the explicit centered
    symmetrical packing. Weight and metal alone would miss it.
